  ============================================================================
  CHILL TONE - everything the app says to the user in this voice
  ============================================================================

  See tone_hype.xml for the file layout, the slot conventions, and what tone does
  and does not reach.

  Chill is calm, warm and never alarming. It speaks in the second person, keeps
  the exclamation marks out, and frames every problem as something the two of you
  handle together rather than something being done to the user.
-->
